      "playstyle": "Stay in human form: spells cast in a form hit at 75% power. Pop Nature's Swiftness and drop Starfall for a double-damage burst, keep Moonfire burning, hold Solar Beam between casts and use Wrath as the cheap filler. Storm Lightning shocks and interrupts, Barkskin and Healing Touch keep you standing, and Mark of the Wild lasts half an hour.",
